        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Hamilton FDP-312-BP Ornate 9 Inch Bronze Flush Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHamilton Bronze Patina flush door pull for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors. Any door where a \"Flush with the door face\" pull is desired. This Large Flush Door Pull is cast in solid bronze with high quality craftsmanship. Traditional ornate style made by master craftsman. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/site/product.cfm?id=204934\"><b>Smaller Ornate 5 Inch Bronze Flush Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Hamilton FDP-312-BP Ornate 9 Inch Bronze Flush Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Bronze Patina</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth:  3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>1/8\" Thick Solid Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish mounting screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FDP-312.pdf?v=1704262229\" target=\"new\"><b>Hamilton FDP-312-BP Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is discontinued.</b> see available <a href=\"/collections/flush-pulls\"><b>Flush Door pulls</b></a>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
